                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Preventing overheating"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reducing friction"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Protecting internal components"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-poor-maintenance-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When fluid becomes contaminated, low, or overheated, the transmission can quickly begin to suffer damage.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-poor-maintenance-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Common maintenance mistakes include:",
                    "align": "left",
