                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keeping your truck running reliably starts with dependable parts. Sun State International's Parts Department carries quality components designed for heavy-duty trucks so you can repair problems quickly and get back on the road. Visit the Sun State International Parts Department to find the parts your truck needs today.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
