                  "id": "p-shifting-habits-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Over thousands of miles, these habits place extra wear on internal components. For fleets and owner-operators alike, training drivers on proper shifting techniques can significantly extend the life of a heavy-duty truck transmission.",
